  // Convolution dimension numbers:
  // input: [b, f, 0] = [batch, feature, length]
  // kernel: [o, i, 0] = [out_channels, in_channels, kernel_length]
  // output: [b, f, 0] = [batch, feature, length]
  //
  // Note: For ConvTranspose1d, the weight shape is (in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size)
  // but here %arg0 is (6x7x5), which matches (batch=6, out_channels=7, kernel=5).
  // The problem states %arg0 is conv1d_transpose.weight, so we interpret:
  // batch dim = in_channels = 6
  // feature dim = out_channels = 7
  // kernel dim = 5
  //
